---`POST /v2/projects/{projectId}/regions/{region}/instances/{instanceId}/clone`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input stackit.mongodb_flex.CloneInstanceRequest
---@return stackit.mongodb_flex.CloneInstanceResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:clone_instance(input) end

